# TemplumIS translations

When creating or editing frontend components, pages, or layouts, follow the **templum-i18n** skill (`.cursor/skills/templum-i18n/SKILL.md`) before finishing.

- No user-visible string may be hardcoded. Use `useLanguage()` from `@/lib/language-context` and `t.*` keys.
- Add every new key to **all 15** files under `frontend/src/lib/i18n/` (`en sw ar fr pt es id ms hi zh th lo my ko vi`).
- Reuse `t.common.*` when the wording already exists. Write real translations — do not paste English into other locales.
- Run `node .cursor/skills/templum-i18n/scripts/check-keys.mjs` after adding keys. Do not finish if it fails.
